@startuml fec
title fec: FEC bulk files + API
start
:bulk zips per cycle (cn, cm, ccl, pas2, weball)
fec.gov/files/bulk-downloads/<cycle>/<stem><yy>.zip;
note right
  Pipe-delimited, no header row: headers come from
  data_dictionaries/<stem>_header_file.csv, except
  weball (columns hard-coded from the FEC docs).
  quote/escape disabled: fields contain bare quotes.
  Landed nationally; filtered to MO in dbt.
end note
:fec_candidates, fec_committees, fec_cand_cmte_links,
fec_committee_contribs_to_candidates, fec_candidate_summary;
:API: committees sponsored by each MO member's
FEC candidate ID (leadership PACs);
if (FEC_API_KEY set (not DEMO_KEY)?) then (yes)
  :schedule_a aggregates by employer / size / state;
endif
if (MOGOV_FEC_INDIV=1?) then (yes)
  :individual contributions (~2.3 GB per cycle);
endif
stop
@enduml
